RESUMEIQ
AI-Powered Resume Analyzer & Career Recommendation Platform

ResumeIQ is an AI-powered career assistance platform designed to help users analyze their resumes, compare them with job descriptions, identify skill gaps, discover relevant career opportunities, and improve their professional profiles.

The platform combines Natural Language Processing (NLP), machine learning, text similarity analysis, and personalized career recommendations within a modern, responsive, and user-friendly web application.

ResumeIQ aims to make career development easier by providing meaningful insights into resume content and helping users understand how their demonstrated skills align with specific job requirements.

Important: ResumeIQ provides text-similarity scores and career guidance. These scores do not represent the probability of getting hired and should not be interpreted as a definitive measure of a candidate's ability or suitability.

