Docker

If the repository contains a valid docker-compose.yml, review its environment variables and service definitions before running:

docker compose up --build

This command is appropriate only after the Docker configuration has been created and checked.

Do not use development credentials or expose private services unnecessarily in production.

⚠️ Limitations

ResumeIQ provides analytical assistance, but its results have limitations.

Resume Parsing

Text extraction may fail on scanned, encrypted, malformed, or image-only PDFs unless OCR support is implemented.

Skill Extraction

Keyword and taxonomy-based extraction can miss synonyms, misunderstand context, or identify a skill without establishing proficiency.

Similarity Scores

TF-IDF and cosine similarity measure textual similarity. They do not evaluate every aspect of a candidate's qualifications, potential, or suitability.

Career Classification

Classification quality depends on the training dataset, label quality, category definitions, and evaluation methodology.

Generative AI

LLM-generated suggestions may be inaccurate or unsuitable. Users should review all generated content before applying it.

External Integrations

Email delivery and optional LLM functionality require valid provider configuration.

Employment Decisions

ResumeIQ does not predict hiring outcomes, guarantee employment, or replace professional career advice.

