Intended Use: Educational project, full-stack development practice, and Generative & Agentic AI project evaluation.

Final Note

ResumeIQ is designed to combine AI-assisted analysis with a secure, maintainable, and user-friendly application architecture.

The goal is to help people better understand their resumes, identify opportunities for improvement, and explore career paths using transparent, explainable analysis.

Analyze your resume. Understand your skills. Explore your next opportunity.

